div.p:
—Normalization of relations with China has enabled
                    us to deal directly and forthrightly with a quarter of the world’s population;
                    buttressed our strategic position.

—Have infused our national commitment to individual freedom and dignity into day-to-day conduct of foreign policy. Human rights
                    considerations now taken into account fully in allocation American assistance;
                    President has signed number of important international human rights covenants.
